    "id": "ebr", 
    "date": "2026-01-12", 
    "title": "Announcing Emerald Battle Revolution!", 
    "tags": ["ebr"], 
    "content": `
[h]{Introduction}
[p]{
Hey everyone! Today, I'm excited to announce what has been a long-term project for me over the past few years - Emerald Battle Revolution!
This is a Pokemon Emerald romhack which is focused around making the Battle Frontier as accessible as possible, and allows players to 
build fully competitive teams, customise battle rules, and more!
}
[p]{
This project is based on [link]{pokeemerald-expansion,https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion} and has support for all moves, 
species and modern battle mechanics up to Generation 9. New species have also been added as opponents to the Battle Frontier and have
randomly generated competitive sets which get more challenging the further you go!
}
[h]{Changes}
[ul]{
New moves, species, battle mechanics, quality of life features, and more - Thanks to the [link]{pokeemerald-expansion,https://github.com/rh-hideout/pokeemerald-expansion} project
Level Scaling for Battle Frontier Facilities (lvl. 50), as well as Battle Tents (lvl. 30)
Completely randomised Battle Frontier opponent mons, including new species - Which scale in difficulty depending on your win streak
Customisable Battle Frontier rules - Change allowed gimmicks, team generation behavior, background music, and more using new NPCs at each facility

}
[h]{Setup}
[ol]{
Download the latest patch from [link]{releases,https://github.com/damon-murdoch/pokeemerald-expansion/releases}
Apply the patch using a rom patcher (recommended: [link]{RomPatcher.js,https://www.marcrobledo.com/RomPatcher.js/})
Download a GBA emulator (recommended: [link]{mGBA,https://mgba.io/downloads.html})
}
[h]{Resources}
[ul]{
[link]{Battle Frontier Underground,index.html?id=ebr-underground}
[link]{Pokemon Learnsets,index.html?id=ebr-learnsets}
}
`
